<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/15th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">Old Zürich War</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1440–1446</span> · <a href="/centuries/15th-century">15th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Old Zürich War was a conflict within the Swiss Confederacy over the inheritance of the last count of Toggenburg, who died in 1436. Zürich, opposed by Schwyz and the other confederates, allied with the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/habsburg-dynasty">Habsburgs</a>. Zürich was defeated and had to give up its Habsburg alliance, and the confederation survived the crisis.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/old-zurich-war.jpg" alt="Old Zürich War" width="320" height="227" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Marco Zanoli (sidonius 20:10, 23 August 2006 (UTC)) · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Karte_Alter_Zuerichkrieg.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
